description:
Implement --format dot for Graphviz rendering:

Generate DOT file with:
- Graph direction: LR (left to right)
- Node attributes: shape, label, color by status
- Edge attributes: relationship type as label
- Subgraphs for disconnected components
- Style matching pebbles aesthetics

Example output:
digraph pebbles_flow {
  rankdir=LR;
  node [shape=box];

  'uuid1' [label='Issue Title' color='green' style=filled];
  'uuid2' [label='Other Issue' color='yellow'];

  'uuid1' -> 'uuid2' [label='required_for'];
}

Allows users to render with: dot -Tsvg flow.dot > flow.svg
Useful for custom layouts and integration with Graphviz ecosystem.
